            "review_title": "Review at Black Wolf bespoke cocktail bar",
            "review_text": "Craig S\n7 contributions\n0\nGreat Staff & delicious cocktails\nApr 2025 • Couples\nBest cocktail bar we have visited, the staff are super friendly and extremely talented.\nNo menu required as you simply request a drink based on your personal flavour preferences and the team at Black Wolf do the rest.\nGreat music, fit out and English speaking staff who make you feel welcome, \nDo yourself a favour & drop in for a Cocktail\nRead more\nWritten April 25, 2025\nBlack Wolf\nWe're really appreciate for taking your precious time writing those review for us. This mean a lot for us to have more motivation to develop our Cocktails Bar day by day❤️ \nCheers🥂🥂\nRead more\nWritten June 29, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
