            "review_title": "Review at Black Wolf bespoke cocktail bar",
            "review_text": "Gdhines\n12 contributions\n0\nGreat drinks, great staff, great place!\nNov 2024 • Couples\nWe were greeted at the door by a member of staff and shown to a table (at the bar or table - your choice!)\nThe bar interior was awesome, very chilled and good music, almost like a speakeasy with black walls and mood lighting!\nThe staff were great, very attentive and couldn’t do enough for us. \nMore importantly, the drinks. There was no menu, so you could order what you wanted.\nWe had classics such as Old Fashioned, Negroni, Aviation as well as telling them the types of drinks we like and they made custom to our taste. \n\nWas a great experience, would highly recommend and was reasonably priced for the service/drinks you get!\nRead more\nWritten November 19, 2024\nBlack Wolf\nWe're really appreciate for taking your precious time writing those review for us. This mean a lot for us to have more motivation to develop our Cocktails Bar day by day❤️ \nCheers🥂🥂\nRead more\nWritten June 29, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
